Package: corpus-querier
Version: @VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Predrag Kovačević
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libx11-6, libxext6, libxrender1, libxft2, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libxcb1, zlib1g
Description: Desktop corpus research tool for NoSketch Engine, Sketch Engine and RNC
 Corpus Querier runs NoSketch Engine and authenticated Sketch Engine CQL,
 plus Russian National Corpus lexical-grammatical searches. It supports batch
 spreadsheets, reusable templates, exact totals and form results.
